{"video":"3KvgRsKSz94","lines":[{"t":[0,2.7],"en":"- Okay, so all we need is a theme."},{"t":[2.7,6.2],"en":"And cups, and ice, and punch, and--"},{"t":[6.2,8.2],"en":"- Okay. - Busy!"},{"t":[8.2,10],"en":"- Hey, what's that show that she's always talking about?"},{"t":[10,11.5],"en":"- Oh my god, is this how you are with Pam?"},{"t":[11.5,13.8],"en":"'Cause she must wanna shoot herself in the face."},{"t":[13.8,15],"en":"- You know what? I could use a little help."},{"t":[15,16.7],"en":"- You know what? I'm a little busy."},{"t":[19.6,21.9],"en":"We have a lot to do,"},{"t":[21.9,26.6],"en":"and you are putting up a very effeminate sign."},{"t":[26.6,27.4],"en":"Is that what you've been doing?"},{"t":[27.4,29.7],"en":"- It's not effeminate. It's festive."},{"t":[29.7,31.2],"en":"- You've been making that sign"},{"t":[31.2,32.4],"en":"for something that we could just announce"},{"t":[32.4,33.5],"en":"to the whole office."},{"t":[33.5,35.5],"en":"Hey, everybody, the party's now at three."},{"t":[35.5,37.8],"en":"- I know, I just read it on the sign."},{"t":[43.6,45.2],"en":"- You have to write my suggestions down, too."},{"t":[45.2,48],"en":"- I'm not writing \"horse hunt.\""},{"t":[48,49.1],"en":"I don't even know what that means."},{"t":[49.1,50.4],"en":"- It's in the name."},{"t":[53.2,57.6],"en":"- Okay, so far, our ideal party consists of"},{"t":[57.6,59.3],"en":"beer, fights to the death,"},{"t":[59.3,62.9],"en":"cupcakes, blood pudding, blood, touch football,"},{"t":[62.9,66.1],"en":"mating, charades, and yes, horse hunting."},{"t":[66.1,67.5],"en":"- You're right. Forget horse hunting."},{"t":[67.5,68.3],"en":"It's stupid."},{"t":[68.3,70.8],"en":"- Is there a birthday that you remember that you loved?"},{"t":[70.8,72.6],"en":"- Here's one."},{"t":[72.6,74.7],"en":"It was dark, warm, wet."},{"t":[76.3,77.7],"en":"A sudden burst of light."},{"t":[77.7,80.3],"en":"An intense pressure like I'd never felt before."},{"t":[80.3,82.7],"en":"Father, dressed in white, pulls me forward."},{"t":[82.7,84],"en":"Mother, bites the cord."},{"t":[84,85.3],"en":"- Okay, stop."},{"t":[85.3,87.3],"en":"Forever stop that story."},{"t":[87.3,89.5],"en":"That's disgusting, and it doesn't count."},{"t":[89.5,90.8],"en":"So give me another one."},{"t":[90.8,93],"en":"- Schrutzen celebrate birthdays, idiot."},{"t":[93,95],"en":"It started as a Depression-era practicality,"},{"t":[95,96.9],"en":"and then moved on to an awesome tradition"},{"t":[96.9,99.1],"en":"that I look forward to every year."},{"t":[99.1,100.6],"en":"What about you?"},{"t":[100.6,101.7],"en":"- When I was seven, my dad took me"},{"t":[101.7,103.9],"en":"to the Natural History Museum in New York,"},{"t":[103.9,105.4],"en":"and we looked at fossils all day."},{"t":[105.4,106.2],"en":"And at the end of the day,"},{"t":[106.2,108.5],"en":"he got me a little plastic triceratops."},{"t":[108.5,109.8],"en":"It was awesome."},{"t":[109.8,110.7],"en":"- That's cool."},{"t":[110.7,113.7],"en":"Hey, you know what's even cooler than triceratops?"},{"t":[113.7,118.2],"en":"Every other dinosaur that ever existed."},{"t":[118.2,120.1],"en":"- Didn't see that one coming."},{"t":[124,124.9],"en":"- Happy birthday."},{"t":[124.9,125.7],"en":"- Surprise."},{"t":[125.7,128.2],"en":"- Hey, it's not a surprise."},{"t":[128.2,130.8],"en":"- This doesn't look good."},{"t":[130.8,131.6],"en":"- What?"},{"t":[131.6,132.6],"en":"You have a cake."},{"t":[132.6,134.3],"en":"You have a delicious cake"},{"t":[134.3,136.4],"en":"with your name spelled correctly."},{"t":[138.5,139.4],"en":"- Told you."},{"t":[139.4,140.5],"en":"- You haven't heard our theme, though."},{"t":[140.5,142.4],"en":"- You don't hear a theme."},{"t":[142.4,143.6],"en":"You see it."},{"t":[143.6,145.4],"en":"Why is there a chiclet on my cake?"},{"t":[145.4,146.4],"en":"- That's the best part."},{"t":[146.4,149],"en":"That represents a pillow or a television."},{"t":[149,150.4],"en":"- Our theme, if you will."},{"t":[150.4,152],"en":"- Because the fun part is you get to decide"},{"t":[152,154.1],"en":"on an hour of television or an hour of napping."},{"t":[154.1,155.1],"en":"- That's our theme."},{"t":[158.1,158.9],"en":"- Cool."},{"t":[158.9,160.5],"en":"- Yeah?"},{"t":[160.5,161.3],"en":"- I love it."},{"t":[161.3,163.1],"en":"- Oh, yes!"},{"t":[163.1,163.8],"en":"Okay, good."},{"t":[163.8,165],"en":"So what's it gonna be, Kapoor?"},{"t":[165,167],"en":"- Ooh, can she pick a half hour of each?"},{"t":[167,167.9],"en":"- No."},{"t":[167.9,169.9],"en":"- Oh, then pick TV."},{"t":[169.9,170.7],"en":"- Take a nap."},{"t":[170.7,171.7],"en":"- No, no, no."},{"t":[171.7,174.4],"en":"- No, watching TV at work is really cool."},{"t":[174.4,176.8],"en":"- Big nap, nothing good is all right now."},{"t":[176.8,177.9],"en":"- Bonnie, honey's on."},{"t":[177.9,178.8],"en":"- You know what?"},{"t":[178.8,179.8],"en":"I have been watching TV all week."},{"t":[179.8,180.8],"en":"I choose nap."},{"t":[180.8,181.7],"en":"- All right."},{"t":[181.7,182.7],"en":"- Okay, nap it is."},{"t":[182.7,183.7],"en":"Everyone out."},{"t":[183.7,185.2],"en":"Get out."},{"t":[185.2,187.3],"en":"We're gonna be eating cake at our desks."},{"t":[187.3,188.3],"en":"Let's go."},{"t":[188.3,190.2],"en":"Move it."},{"t":[190.2,191.4],"en":"Let's go, go, go, go, go."},{"t":[191.4,192.4],"en":"Come on."},{"t":[192.4,193.3],"en":"- Happy birthday."},{"t":[193.3,195.1],"en":"- I got this."},{"t":[195.1,197],"en":"Ahem."},{"t":[197,198.5],"en":"This is for you."},{"t":[198.5,201.4],"en":"And happy birthday, Kel."},{"t":[201.4,202.4],"en":"- Thank you."},{"t":[202.4,203.1],"en":"- Okay."},{"t":[203.1,206.9],"en":"You've got one hour."},{"t":[206.9,210.9],"en":"- I'm too excited to sleep."},{"t":[210.9,211.7],"en":"- Mm."},{"t":[211.7,211.9],"en":"Great cake."},{"t":[211.9,212],"en":"Thanks."},{"t":[212,223.4],"en":"- I'm too excited to sleep."},{"t":[223.4,224.6],"en":"- Mm."},{"t":[224.6,225.5],"en":"Great cake."},{"t":[225.5,226.5],"en":"- Thanks."},{"t":[226.5,227.3],"en":"- Thanks."},{"t":[241.6,242.7],"en":"- Birthday time is over."},{"t":[242.7,245.7],"en":"Now go make up for all the work you missed when you were taking your nap."},{"t":[245.7,247.3],"en":"- Many happy returns."},{"t":[247.3,251.3],"en":"- Many happy returns."}]}
